<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes soft at 477.25/478.25/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes soft at 477.25/478.25/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan dollar closed softer at 477.25/478.25 per dollar but traders saw a firmer rate Wednesday following expected rises in yields at tomorrow's Central Bank auction of TEMs.</p>
<p>&quot;The market should settle flat tomorrow when we expect TEM yields to rise,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>The unit closed Monday at 476.75/477.75 bolivars per dollar.</p>
<p>(( -- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
